24a2.avif?t=1793194385\" width=574 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the builds of other players in different game modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unranked</strong>: Low pressure without timers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ranked</strong>: Gain points against equal opponents, but still at your own pace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom rules</strong>: Play unranked but change gold, maximum health, and more</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lobbies</strong>: Match friends or streamers live with a timer!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See what they came up with, and counter them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427700/extras/6975fc7d7311b2167c9f635eafb2a6ca.avif?t=1793194385\" width=574 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick one of <strong>7 classes</strong> depending on your play style, each of them with <strong>5 subclasses</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you want heavy crits or poison damage over time? Or <i>squirrels</i>? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427700/extras/529599ef1f6a1072a85d6eb8e7bcf5db.avif?t=1793194385\" width=1560 height=482 /></span></p>", "short_description": "A PvP inventory management auto battler! Buy and craft powerful items, then carefully arrange them in your backpack.", "supported_languages": "English, German, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, French, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Spanish - Latin America", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427700/75fd59d3c14c32bbba9be83dca